{
  "meta": {
    "id": "abfon",
    "title": "AFON／BFON 儀器校正",
    "subtitle": "儀器主檔 × 年度校正報告 · 假資料試玩熟悉系統"
  },
  "roles": [
    { "id": "afon_staff", "label": "儀器管理員（AFON）" },
    { "id": "bfon_staff", "label": "校正人員（BFON）" },
    { "id": "qa", "label": "品保" }
  ],
  "form": {
    "title": "AFON 儀器主檔 ＋ BFON 校正報告",
    "statusField": "workflow_status",
    "sections": [
      {
        "id": "afon",
        "label": "AFON · 儀器主檔",
        "fields": [
          {
            "id": "asset_no",
            "label": "儀器編號",
            "type": "text",
            "placeholder": "例如 AFON-2024-0012",
            "meaning": "這台儀器在全公司的身分證字號；之後所有校正報告都掛在這個號碼上",
            "acl": {
              "requiredFrom": ["afon_staff"],
              "read": ["afon_staff", "bfon_staff", "qa"],
              "write": ["afon_staff"]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "asset_name",
            "label": "儀器名稱",
            "type": "text",
            "placeholder": "例如 光學顯微鏡",
            "meaning": "人看得懂的名字；編號給系統對帳，名稱給人找機器",
            "acl": {
              "requiredFrom": ["afon_staff"],
              "read": ["afon_staff", "bfon_staff", "qa"],
              "write": ["afon_staff"]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "model",
            "label": "型號",
            "type": "text",
            "placeholder": "廠牌型號",
            "meaning": "校正程序常依型號不同；寫錯會對到錯的校正規範",
            "acl": {
              "requiredFrom": ["afon_staff"],
              "read": ["afon_staff", "bfon_staff", "qa"],
              "write": ["afon_staff"]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "location",
            "label": "放置地點",
            "type": "text",
            "placeholder": "實驗室／產線位置",
            "meaning": "校正人員要找得到機器；搬過沒改，BFON 就會跑錯現場",
            "acl": {
              "requiredFrom": [],
              "read": ["afon_staff", "bfon_staff", "qa"],
              "write": ["afon_staff"]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "owner",
            "label": "保管人",
            "type": "text",
            "placeholder": "儀器管理員姓名",
            "meaning": "AFON 這一側的窗口；不是校正工程師",
            "autoPersona": true,
            "acl": {
              "requiredFrom": ["afon_staff"],
              "read": ["afon_staff", "bfon_staff", "qa"],
              "write": ["afon_staff"]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "qualify_flag",
            "label": "合格狀態",
            "type": "select",
            "options": ["合格", "待校正", "不合格", "停用"],
            "meaning": "主檔上的『現在能不能用』；由最近一次 BFON 結果回寫，不是手填心情",
            "acl": {
              "requiredFrom": [],
              "read": ["afon_staff", "bfon_staff", "qa"],
              "write": ["afon_staff"]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "next_cal_date",
            "label": "下次校正日",
            "type": "date",
            "meaning": "主檔上的到期日；過了就不能當合格儀器用。BFON 完成後會覆寫這裡",
            "acl": {
              "requiredFrom": [],
              "read": ["afon_staff", "bfon_staff", "qa"],
              "write": ["afon_staff"]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "related_bfon",
            "label": "關聯 BFON",
            "type": "textarea",
            "placeholder": "從此主檔可看到的校正報告清單",
            "meaning": "為什麼開 AFON：不是只看一台機器，而是要看到『這台機器歷年校正報告』",
            "acl": {
              "requiredFrom": [],
              "read": ["afon_staff", "bfon_staff", "qa"],
              "write": ["afon_staff"]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "bfon",
        "label": "BFON · 年度校正報告",
        "fields": [
          {
            "id": "report_no",
            "label": "報告編號",
            "type": "text",
            "placeholder": "例如 BFON-2026-0088",
            "meaning": "每一次校正事件的單號；同一台 AFON 會有很多張 BFON",
            "acl": {
              "requiredFrom": ["bfon_staff"],
              "read": ["afon_staff", "bfon_staff", "qa"],
              "write": ["bfon_staff"]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "link_asset_no",
            "label": "掛接儀器",
            "type": "text",
            "placeholder": "必須等於 AFON 儀器編號",
            "meaning": "跨單關聯：BFON 一定要掛到某張 AFON，否則報告 orphan、主檔也回寫不回去",
            "acl": {
              "requiredFrom": ["bfon_staff"],
              "read": ["afon_staff", "bfon_staff", "qa"],
              "write": ["bfon_staff"]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "cal_date",
            "label": "校正日期",
            "type": "date",
            "meaning": "這次事件發生日；用來算下次校正日、也用來排序『最新一次』",
            "acl": {
              "requiredFrom": ["bfon_staff"],
              "read": ["afon_staff", "bfon_staff", "qa"],
              "write": ["bfon_staff"]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "cal_cycle_months",
            "label": "週期（月）",
            "type": "text",
            "placeholder": "12",
            "meaning": "年度校正常見 12 個月；週期 × 校正日 → 建議下次校正日",
            "acl": {
              "requiredFrom": ["bfon_staff"],
              "read": ["afon_staff", "bfon_staff", "qa"],
              "write": ["bfon_staff"]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "technician",
            "label": "校正人員",
            "type": "text",
            "placeholder": "BFON 側執行者",
            "meaning": "BFON 這一側的窗口；跟 AFON 保管人是不同單位的人",
            "autoPersona": true,
            "acl": {
              "requiredFrom": ["bfon_staff"],
              "read": ["afon_staff", "bfon_staff", "qa"],
              "write": ["bfon_staff"]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "result",
            "label": "校正結果",
            "type": "select",
            "options": ["合格", "不合格", "限制使用"],
            "meaning": "這次事件的結論；完成後會回寫 AFON 的合格狀態",
            "acl": {
              "requiredFrom": ["bfon_staff"],
              "read": ["afon_staff", "bfon_staff", "qa"],
              "write": ["bfon_staff"]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "suggested_next",
            "label": "建議下次校正日",
            "type": "date",
            "meaning": "本張 BFON 算出來的日期；結案合格時寫回 AFON.next_cal_date",
            "acl": {
              "requiredFrom": ["bfon_staff"],
              "read": ["afon_staff", "bfon_staff", "qa"],
              "write": ["bfon_staff"]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "bfon_comment",
            "label": "校正備註",
            "type": "textarea",
            "placeholder": "標準件、偏差、環境條件…",
            "meaning": "給未來的自己與稽核看：這次為什麼合格／不合格",
            "acl": {
              "requiredFrom": [],
              "read": ["afon_staff", "bfon_staff", "qa"],
              "write": ["bfon_staff"]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "qa_sec",
        "label": "品保覆核",
        "fields": [
          {
            "id": "qa_name",
            "label": "覆核人",
            "type": "text",
            "meaning": "第三方確認這張 BFON 能不能生效回寫主檔",
            "autoPersona": true,
            "acl": {
              "requiredFrom": ["qa"],
              "read": ["afon_staff", "bfon_staff", "qa"],
              "write": ["qa"]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "qa_date",
            "label": "覆核日",
            "type": "date",
            "autoToday": true,
            "meaning": "何時放行",
            "acl": {
              "requiredFrom": ["qa"],
              "read": ["afon_staff", "bfon_staff", "qa"],
              "write": ["qa"]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "qa_comment",
            "label": "覆核意見",
            "type": "textarea",
            "placeholder": "同意回寫主檔／退回補件",
            "meaning": "放行或退回的理由",
            "acl": {
              "requiredFrom": ["qa"],
              "read": ["afon_staff", "bfon_staff", "qa"],
              "write": ["qa"]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "close",
        "label": "流程狀態",
        "fields": [
          {
            "id": "workflow_status",
            "label": "目前狀態",
            "type": "text",
            "meaning": "整條 AFON→BFON→回寫 走到哪：草稿／主檔已建／校正中／待品保／已回寫／不合格停用",
            "acl": {
              "requiredFrom": [],
              "read": ["afon_staff", "bfon_staff", "qa"],
              "write": []
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "actions": [
    {
      "id": "save_afon",
      "label": "建立／更新儀器主檔",
      "role": "afon_staff",
      "whenStatus": ["", "草稿", "主檔已建", "待校正", "不合格停用"],
      "require": ["asset_no", "asset_name", "model", "owner"],
      "set": { "workflow_status": "主檔已建", "qualify_flag": "待校正" },
      "autoPersona": ["owner"],
      "message": "AFON 主檔已就緒。可從「關聯 BFON」看到這台機器的校正報告；接著請校正單位開 BFON。"
    },
    {
      "id": "submit_bfon",
      "label": "送出校正報告給品保",
      "role": "bfon_staff",
      "whenStatus": ["主檔已建", "校正中", "待修改"],
      "require": ["report_no", "link_asset_no", "cal_date", "technician", "result", "suggested_next"],
      "set": { "workflow_status": "待品保" },
      "autoPersona": ["technician"],
      "message": "BFON 已送出。品保覆核通過後，才會回寫 AFON 的下次校正日與合格狀態。"
    },
    {
      "id": "qa_pass",
      "label": "覆核通過並回寫主檔",
      "role": "qa",
      "whenStatus": ["待品保"],
      "require": ["qa_comment"],
      "set": {
        "workflow_status": "已回寫",
        "qualify_flag": "合格"
      },
      "copy": { "suggested_next": "next_cal_date" },
      "autoPersona": ["qa_name"],
      "autoToday": ["qa_date"],
      "message": "已放行：已把 BFON 的建議下次校正日回寫到 AFON 主檔，合格狀態＝合格。"
    },
    {
      "id": "qa_return",
      "label": "退回校正補件",
      "role": "qa",
      "whenStatus": ["待品保"],
      "require": ["qa_comment"],
      "set": { "workflow_status": "待修改" },
      "autoPersona": ["qa_name"],
      "autoToday": ["qa_date"],
      "message": "已退回 BFON。校正人員可改完再送。"
    },
    {
      "id": "fail_hold",
      "label": "判定不合格並停用儀器",
      "role": "qa",
      "whenStatus": ["待品保"],
      "require": ["qa_comment"],
      "set": {
        "workflow_status": "不合格停用",
        "qualify_flag": "不合格",
        "result": "不合格"
      },
      "autoPersona": ["qa_name"],
      "autoToday": ["qa_date"],
      "message": "主檔標不合格／停用。這台顯微鏡在重新校正合格前不應再使用。"
    }
  ],
  "tables": [
    {
      "id": "afon",
      "label": "AFON 儀器主檔（長期）",
      "fields": [
        { "label": "儀器編號", "origin": "全公司身分證；BFON 都掛這碼" },
        { "label": "名稱／型號／地點", "origin": "人找機器、校正對規範、現場找得到" },
        { "label": "保管人", "origin": "AFON 側窗口，與校正單位不同" },
        { "label": "合格狀態／下次校正日", "origin": "『現在能不能用』住在主檔；由 BFON 回寫" },
        { "label": "關聯 BFON", "origin": "從主檔看出這台機器的校正報告族譜" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "bfon",
      "label": "BFON 校正報告（每次事件）",
      "fields": [
        { "label": "報告編號", "origin": "每一次年度（或臨時）校正事件" },
        { "label": "掛接儀器", "origin": "跨單關聯：一定要連到 AFON" },
        { "label": "校正日／週期／建議下次", "origin": "事件時間軸與回寫來源" },
        { "label": "校正人員／結果／備註", "origin": "BFON 側責任與稽核軌跡" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "show": {
    "cast": [
      { "id": "narrator", "label": "旁白", "tone": "soft" },
      { "id": "you", "label": "你（初學者）", "tone": "user" },
      { "id": "guide", "label": "系統顧問", "tone": "guide" },
      { "id": "afon", "label": "儀器管理員", "tone": "manager" },
      { "id": "bfon", "label": "校正工程師", "tone": "hr" },
      { "id": "qa", "label": "品保", "tone": "guide" }
    ],
    "start": "s01",
    "nodes": {
      "s01": {
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "line": "這是一套量測儀器管理：AFON 管『機器本身』，BFON 管『每次校正報告』。兩邊各有自己的人。我們用假資料帶你走一遍。",
        "next": "s02"
      },
      "s02": {
        "speaker": "you",
        "line": "我對這系統完全不熟。聽說有一台顯微鏡？報告又是什麼？",
        "next": "s03"
      },
      "s03": {
        "speaker": "guide",
        "line": "先記一句話：AFON＝儀器身分證（長期）；BFON＝年度校正事件（每次一張）。從 AFON 可以看見這台機器相關的 BFON。",
        "next": "s04"
      },
      "s04": {
        "speaker": "afon",
        "line": "我是儀器管理員。先幫你建這台光學顯微鏡的主檔——第一欄「儀器編號」是全公司對帳用的號碼。",
        "focus": "asset_no",
        "unlockSection": "afon",
        "reveal": ["asset_no"],
        "fillFromDemo": ["asset_no"],
        "typewriter": true,
        "next": "s05"
      },
      "s05": {
        "speaker": "afon",
        "line": "「儀器名稱」給人看：這是光學顯微鏡，不是一串代號。",
        "focus": "asset_name",
        "reveal": ["asset_name"],
        "fillFromDemo": ["asset_name"],
        "typewriter": true,
        "next": "s06"
      },
      "s06": {
        "speaker": "afon",
        "line": "「型號」很重要——校正程序常依型號不同；寫錯會對到錯的規範。",
        "focus": "model",
        "reveal": ["model"],
        "fillFromDemo": ["model"],
        "typewriter": true,
        "next": "s07"
      },
      "s07": {
        "speaker": "afon",
        "line": "「放置地點」是給校正同事找機器用的。搬過沒改，他們會跑錯實驗室。",
        "focus": "location",
        "reveal": ["location"],
        "fillFromDemo": ["location"],
        "typewriter": true,
        "next": "s08"
      },
      "s08": {
        "speaker": "afon",
        "line": "「保管人」是 AFON 這一側的窗口——是我，不是校正工程師。兩邊人員分開，責任才清楚。",
        "focus": "owner",
        "reveal": ["owner"],
        "fillFromDemo": ["owner"],
        "typewriter": true,
        "next": "s09"
      },
      "s09": {
        "speaker": "guide",
        "line": "主檔還有兩個『現在能不能用』的欄位：合格狀態、下次校正日。新機器先標待校正。",
        "focus": "qualify_flag",
        "reveal": ["qualify_flag", "next_cal_date"],
        "fillFromDemo": ["qualify_flag", "next_cal_date"],
        "typewriter": true,
        "next": "s10"
      },
      "s10": {
        "speaker": "afon",
        "line": "重點來了：從這張 AFON，我看得到『關聯 BFON』——歷年校正報告清單。還沒校正前，只有去年那張假報告當例子。",
        "focus": "related_bfon",
        "reveal": ["related_bfon", "workflow_status"],
        "fillFromDemo": ["related_bfon_before", "status_master"],
        "mapFill": {
          "related_bfon_before": "related_bfon",
          "status_master": "workflow_status"
        },
        "typewriter": true,
        "next": "s11"
      },
      "s11": {
        "speaker": "you",
        "line": "所以我開 AFON 不是只看機器規格，而是要追這台機器的校正族譜？",
        "next": "s12"
      },
      "s12": {
        "speaker": "guide",
        "line": "對。現在換 BFON 側的人上場——他們幫你做一張『今年』的假校正報告，讓你摸摸流程。",
        "next": "s13"
      },
      "s13": {
        "speaker": "bfon",
        "line": "我是校正工程師。「報告編號」是這一次事件的單號——同一台顯微鏡，每年會多一張 BFON。",
        "focus": "report_no",
        "unlockSection": "bfon",
        "reveal": ["report_no"],
        "fillFromDemo": ["report_no"],
        "typewriter": true,
        "next": "s14"
      },
      "s14": {
        "speaker": "bfon",
        "line": "「掛接儀器」一定要等於 AFON 的儀器編號。掛錯或空白，報告會變成 orphan，主檔也回寫不回去。",
        "focus": "link_asset_no",
        "reveal": ["link_asset_no"],
        "fillFromDemo": ["link_asset_no"],
        "typewriter": true,
        "next": "s15"
      },
      "s15": {
        "speaker": "bfon",
        "line": "校正日期、週期（月）、建議下次校正日——用來算時間軸，也是回寫主檔的來源。",
        "focus": "cal_date",
        "reveal": ["cal_date", "cal_cycle_months", "suggested_next"],
        "fillFromDemo": ["cal_date", "cal_cycle_months", "suggested_next"],
        "typewriter": true,
        "next": "s16"
      },
      "s16": {
        "speaker": "bfon",
        "line": "「校正人員」是 BFON 側窗口。我填自己，並先標結果為合格，備註寫標準件與環境條件。",
        "focus": "technician",
        "reveal": ["technician", "result", "bfon_comment"],
        "fillFromDemo": ["technician", "result_ok", "bfon_comment_ok"],
        "mapFill": {
          "result_ok": "result",
          "bfon_comment_ok": "bfon_comment"
        },
        "typewriter": true,
        "next": "s17"
      },
      "s17": {
        "speaker": "guide",
        "line": "報告送出品保前，AFON 的關聯清單會多出這張今年的 BFON——兩邊就對上了。",
        "focus": "related_bfon",
        "reveal": ["related_bfon"],
        "fillFromDemo": ["related_bfon_after", "status_pending_qa"],
        "mapFill": {
          "related_bfon_after": "related_bfon",
          "status_pending_qa": "workflow_status"
        },
        "typewriter": true,
        "next": "s18"
      },
      "s18": {
        "speaker": "guide",
        "line": "關鍵選擇：這張假報告，品保要怎麼收？",
        "choices": [
          { "id": "pass", "label": "覆核通過 → 回寫主檔（合格）", "next": "b_pass" },
          { "id": "return", "label": "退回校正補件", "next": "b_return" },
          { "id": "fail", "label": "不合格 → 儀器停用", "next": "b_fail" }
        ]
      },
      "b_pass": {
        "speaker": "qa",
        "line": "我是品保。意見：數據完整，同意回寫。主檔合格狀態＝合格，下次校正日改成 BFON 建議日。",
        "focus": "qa_comment",
        "unlockSection": "qa_sec",
        "reveal": ["qa_name", "qa_date", "qa_comment", "qualify_flag", "next_cal_date", "workflow_status"],
        "fillFromDemo": [
          "qa_name",
          "qa_date",
          "qa_comment_ok",
          "qualify_ok",
          "next_cal_after",
          "status_done"
        ],
        "mapFill": {
          "qa_comment_ok": "qa_comment",
          "qualify_ok": "qualify_flag",
          "next_cal_after": "next_cal_date",
          "status_done": "workflow_status"
        },
        "typewriter": true,
        "next": "s_end"
      },
